{% include "approved-en/header.njk" %}
<main id="main" class="locked-page">
  <article class="locked-copy">
    <h1>Accessibility</h1>
    <p>Toza aims to make this website usable by people with disabilities. The website includes text alternatives for informative images, keyboard navigation and a link to skip to the main content. You can enlarge the text using your browser's zoom controls.</p>
    <p>If you encounter an accessibility problem or need information in another format, please contact Toza through <a href="https://wa.me/972533366276">WhatsApp</a> or <a href="https://signal.me/#p/+972533366276">Signal</a>. Please identify the page and describe the difficulty so we can understand your request. Please do not include sensitive personal information in your first message.</p>
    <p>Toza provides its service at locations selected by clients. Please contact Toza to discuss accessibility requirements for your appointment.</p>
  </article>
</main>
{% include "approved-en/footer.njk" %}
{% include "approved-en/contact-icons.njk" %}
</body>
